1
00:00:28,116 --> 00:00:29,699
温特 不要怪我
Winter do not blame me.

2
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,199
我已经舍弃一切了
I've sacrificed everything.

3
00:00:36,574 --> 00:00:40,116
不是 你只是牺牲了所有其他人
No, you have sacrificed everyone else.

4
00:00:40,408 --> 00:00:41,699
边境是你封锁的
You closed the borders.

5
00:00:41,741 --> 00:00:43,699
是你压榨曼特到其崩溃的
You squeezed Mantle until it broke.

6
00:00:52,283 --> 00:00:54,866
我做的一切都是为了树不子好
I've only done what's best for Remnant.

7
00:00:55,408 --> 00:00:57,491
却没人感激半分
And no one is grateful.

8
00:00:58,366 --> 00:00:59,574
啊
Ahhh!

9
00:01:16,658 --> 00:01:17,866
首要优先撤离
Priority one.

10
00:01:21,199 --> 00:01:25,199
Weiss 她从头到尾都只想要少女力量
Weiss, all she's ever wanted is the maiden power.

11
00:01:25,241 --> 00:01:27,199
我可以为你们争取时间
I can buy you all time.

12
00:01:27,408 --> 00:01:28,116
但 Penny
But, Penny.

13
00:01:28,241 --> 00:01:28,283
但 Penny

14
00:01:39,449 --> 00:01:40,574
我就在这
I'm right here.

15
00:01:41,408 --> 00:01:42,491
你是想要我吧
I'm what you want.

16
00:01:43,699 --> 00:01:45,241
我全都要
I want it all.

17
00:01:46,283 --> 00:01:48,116
哎呀
Gahhh!

18
00:01:51,324 --> 00:01:52,199
起来!
Get up!

19
00:02:02,741 --> 00:02:05,158
哈利特 这样会铸成大错的
You're making a mistake, Harriet.

20
00:02:05,783 --> 00:02:07,824
克洛弗的事 我很抱歉
What happened to Clover, I regret-

21
00:02:07,991 --> 00:02:08,866
闭嘴!
Shut up already!

22
00:02:17,074 --> 00:02:18,116
让开!
Get out of the way!

23
00:02:23,449 --> 00:02:25,783
哈利 别这样做
Hare, please don't do this.

24
00:02:25,824 --> 00:02:27,783
曼特城的人们还在撤离
They're still evacuating in Mantle.

25
00:02:28,074 --> 00:02:30,283
为什么你们就是不让我完成工作!
Why can't you just let me do my job.

26
00:02:30,324 --> 00:02:32,283
因为你是我们的朋友!
Because you're our friend!

27
00:02:32,699 --> 00:02:34,491
我们不能让你这样做
And we won't let you go through with this.

28
00:02:37,824 --> 00:02:38,533
不!
No!

29
00:03:08,866 --> 00:03:10,408
不许动她
Leavesher alone

30
00:03:19,783 --> 00:03:20,616
Blake!
Blake!

31
00:03:22,616 --> 00:03:24,783
来吧 我们得为了Yang而战
Come on, we have to do this for Yang.

32
00:03:28,408 --> 00:03:29,241
不!
No!

33
00:03:54,783 --> 00:03:56,241
自动导航锁定了
The autopilot's locked.

34
00:03:56,533 --> 00:03:57,574
我们得溜了!
We've gotta go.

35
00:03:58,241 --> 00:04:00,366
来不及离开爆炸范围了
There's no time to make it out of the blast range.

36
00:04:01,074 --> 00:04:02,866
我害死了我们所有人
I've killed us all.

37
00:04:03,783 --> 00:04:04,866
对不起
I'm sorry.

38
00:04:17,408 --> 00:04:17,866
不要
No.

39
00:04:18,783 --> 00:04:19,449
你不能这样做!
You can't!

40
00:04:20,283 --> 00:04:23,574
如果可以拯救我所有朋友的话 我能
I can, if it means saving all of my friends.

41
00:04:26,116 --> 00:04:27,199
不要!
No!

42
00:05:05,658 --> 00:05:07,366
你为了什么也好
Whatever you wanted

43
00:05:10,074 --> 00:05:11,283
希望你觉得值了
I hope it was worth it.

44
00:05:29,324 --> 00:05:31,449
你不该威胁我的
You should've never threatened me.

45
00:05:34,574 --> 00:05:35,324
而你...
And you...

46
00:05:35,533 --> 00:05:38,574
根本就不应该出生
should have never been born.

47
00:05:41,449 --> 00:05:42,491
Ruby!
Ruby!

48
00:06:00,449 --> 00:06:00,699
不!
No!

49
00:06:03,074 --> 00:06:04,241
滚开!
Get back!

50
00:06:09,616 --> 00:06:12,699
梅 乔安娜 还有所有通过了传送门的猎人
May, Joanna, any Huntsman that went through that gate,

51
00:06:12,741 --> 00:06:13,908
都带过来
bring 'em here.

52
00:06:19,074 --> 00:06:20,408
果然最后留下的
It figures that a Schnee

53
00:06:20,449 --> 00:06:22,408
是雪倪家族的人
would be the last one standing.

54
00:06:22,658 --> 00:06:25,033
先让她所有朋友去死
Letting all her friends die first

55
00:06:31,449 --> 00:06:34,533
你对友情一无所知
You wouldn't know anything about friends.

56
00:06:51,241 --> 00:06:52,491
她回来了
She's back.

57
00:06:53,658 --> 00:06:55,199
啊!
Ahhhh!

58
00:07:25,366 --> 00:07:26,074
Penny!
Penny!

59
00:07:28,574 --> 00:07:31,199
等着 用我的外像力
Just...Hold on, my Semblance-

60
00:07:31,408 --> 00:07:31,824
不
No.

61
00:07:33,616 --> 00:07:35,741
已经没有为我疗伤的时间了
There's not enough time to heal me.

62
00:07:37,408 --> 00:07:40,449
不能让她拿到权杖和少女之力
She can't get the staff and the power,

63
00:07:42,408 --> 00:07:46,241
但你可以做一件事
but there is something you can do.

64
00:07:47,408 --> 00:07:49,408
我 我不知道其他人在哪
No, I-I don't know where the others are,

65
00:07:49,574 --> 00:07:51,283
但是Weiss会为我们争取时间的
but Weiss will give us time.

66
00:07:52,533 --> 00:07:56,491
让我来做一次选择吧
Let me choose this one thing.

67
00:07:58,158 --> 00:07:59,074
相信我
Trust me.

68
00:08:41,949 --> 00:08:44,324
向你致敬!
Salutations!

69
00:08:44,866 --> 00:08:45,949
你来了
You made it

70
00:08:48,449 --> 00:08:49,116
这是哪…
Where...

71
00:08:51,074 --> 00:08:52,074
这是什么
What is this.

72
00:08:53,408 --> 00:08:55,824
我想到你了 然后我们就到这儿了
I thought of you and here we are.

73
00:08:58,283 --> 00:08:59,283
噢 Penny
Oh, Penny.

74
00:09:00,366 --> 00:09:02,241
最合适的人选应该是你
It seemed fitting that it should be you.

75
00:09:02,824 --> 00:09:04,491
毕竟这本就是该属于你的力量
It was your power after all.

76
00:09:06,033 --> 00:09:09,991
不 Penny 你才拥有真正少女之心
No, Penny, you were always the real Maiden at heart.

77
00:09:11,074 --> 00:09:12,324
我只是一个机器
I was just the machine.

78
00:09:13,116 --> 00:09:15,241
只会奉命行事
Just following orders.

79
00:09:23,241 --> 00:09:24,283
你是我的朋友
You were my friend.

80
00:09:31,866 --> 00:09:34,699
谢谢你愿意信任我
Thank you for trusting me with this.

81
00:09:35,741 --> 00:09:37,158
在你离开后…
When you're gone...

82
00:09:38,658 --> 00:09:39,866
我不会离开的
I won't be gone.

83
00:09:41,033 --> 00:09:42,324
我会一直是你的一部分
TIl be part of you.

84
00:09:43,908 --> 00:09:46,908
好 我很欣慰
Good, I'm glad.

85
00:09:58,449 --> 00:10:02,533
看来我为你选择的命运终于到来了
So the destiny I chose for you has arrived.

86
00:10:04,741 --> 00:10:06,241
你没有为我选择任何事
You chose nothing.

87
00:10:08,658 --> 00:10:10,116
这是一份礼物
This was a gift,.

88
00:10:36,449 --> 00:10:37,866
力量去哪了?!
Where did it go?!

89
00:11:32,824 --> 00:11:33,991
不
No.

90
00:11:38,449 --> 00:11:39,574
Weiss!
Weiss!

91
00:12:08,574 --> 00:12:09,991
我们得走了
We need to go.

92
00:12:12,908 --> 00:12:18,116
你会为你所做过的一切付出代价
You are going to pay for everything you've done

93
00:13:44,533 --> 00:13:47,449
我…我又失败了 主人
I...I failed you again, master.

94
00:13:48,158 --> 00:13:51,158
他们用权杖救了数千人
They used the staff to save thousands

95
00:13:51,408 --> 00:13:54,366
在我们的伙伴被击溃前 妮奥波莉丹
before our allies fell, Neopolitan...

96
00:13:54,949 --> 00:13:57,199
杀掉了Ruby
killed Ruby.

97
00:13:57,824 --> 00:13:59,949
在Ruby和她的同伴们坠落前
And before Ruby and her teammates fell,

98
00:14:00,366 --> 00:14:02,533
他们问了神灯最后一个问题
they use the lamp's final question.

99
00:14:02,866 --> 00:14:04,283
我无法阻止他们
I couldn't stop them.

100
00:14:04,324 --> 00:14:08,699
我甚至无法在保全圣物的前提下阻止少女逃离
I couldn't even stop the Maiden from escaping without putting the relics in jeopardy.

101
00:14:09,283 --> 00:14:09,866
我…
I'm...

102
00:14:12,324 --> 00:14:13,741
非常抱歉
I'm sorry.

103
00:14:19,408 --> 00:14:24,866
在创造新世界的过程中 付出再大的代价也没关系
In pursuit of a new world no cost is too great.

104
00:14:26,074 --> 00:14:27,949
你做的很好 馨德
You've done well, Cinder.

105
00:14:29,283 --> 00:14:31,283
我们在这儿的工作结束了
Our work here is done.

106
00:14:37,908 --> 00:14:40,158
你说他们用了权杖
You said they used the staff.

107
00:14:42,158 --> 00:14:45,366
我想你也把他们所创造的东西消除了吧
I assume you rid the world of their creation.

108
00:14:48,116 --> 00:14:50,408
那你又创造了什么?
What did you create in its stead?

109
00:14:52,074 --> 00:14:55,366
我只不过是加大了擎天的火势
I merely added more flames to the fires of Atlas.

110
00:14:58,283 --> 00:14:59,533
救命!
Help!

111
00:15:06,199 --> 00:15:07,949
而那便是 将军
And that's checkmate.